WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.329
It's time to admit

00:00:02.099 --> 00:00:04.893
that the playbook that&nbsp;
guided businesses and CEOs

00:00:04.893 --> 00:00:06.486
for the last 40 years

00:00:06.486 --> 00:00:07.345
is broken.

00:00:07.345 --> 00:00:09.915
The CEO playbook says it's&nbsp;
about shareholders.

00:00:10.321 --> 00:00:12.685
And so much is sacrificed for it --

00:00:12.685 --> 00:00:14.779
it's factories, communities, jobs.

00:00:15.142 --> 00:00:18.542
But yet, the CEOs's pay goes up and up and up.

00:00:18.542 --> 00:00:21.286
And so many people are left behind.

00:00:21.286 --> 00:00:22.503
I'm&nbsp;here to tell you:

00:00:22.919 --> 00:00:24.184
no more.

00:00:24.184 --> 00:00:27.675
The new anti-CEO playbook is about community.

00:00:27.675 --> 00:00:29.094
If you are right

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:30.775
with your people,

00:00:30.775 --> 00:00:32.576
you will be more innovative,

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:35.458
you will have more passionate
people working for&nbsp;you

00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:37.179
and a community that supports you.

00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:40.342
And that's what the anti-CEO playbook is all about.

00:00:40.342 --> 00:00:42.348
This is&nbsp;the difference between

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:46.088
profit and true wealth.

